Identification: move-wide/from16.
Encoding: 22x; AA:op BBBB; 2 code unit(s).
Validity class: standard. Applicable versions: 035,037,038,039,040,041.

Copy the complete original sixty-four-bit source pair named by B into the pair named by A. Read both source halves before any destination write, including when the pairs overlap by one word.

