ENTRY 014 — 0x0d — MOVE-EXCEPTION.

Identification: move-exception.
Encoding: 11x; AA:op; 1 code unit(s).
Validity class: standard. Applicable versions: 035,037,038,039,040,041.

Save the exception object delivered to this handler in register A so that the handler can use it. The instruction itself does not throw that object again.

