Identification: return.
Encoding: 11x; AA:op; 1 code unit(s).
Validity class: standard. Applicable versions: 035,037,038,039,040,041.

Read the single-word primitive value in A and return that value from this method. End the current invocation and make the value available to its caller.

Reads: vA; method exit state.
Changes: caller primitive result; frame removed.
Execution index: Return to caller.
Operand and contextual validity: RETURN: register and declared return type agree, including narrow primitive compatibility.
Exceptional completion: EXIT rules.
