ENTRY 220 — 0xdb — DIV-INT/LIT8.

Identification: div-int/lit8.
Encoding: 22b; AA:op CC:BB; 2 code unit(s).
Validity class: standard. Applicable versions: 035,037,038,039,040,041.

Use sign-extended eight-bit C as the signed divisor of B. Truncate toward zero and write A; zero C throws ArithmeticException. Minimum int divided by minus one remains minimum int.

