ENTRY 221 — 0xdc — REM-INT/LIT8.

Identification: rem-int/lit8.
Encoding: 22b; AA:op CC:BB; 2 code unit(s).
Validity class: standard. Applicable versions: 035,037,038,039,040,041.

Divide signed B conceptually by sign-extended eight-bit C with truncation toward zero, then retain the remainder in A. Zero C throws ArithmeticException and minimum int remainder minus one is zero.

